# No EF migrations

- NEVER create, generate, scaffold, or edit EF Core migration files (`dotnet ef migrations add`, Designer/Snapshot churn for new migrations, hand-written `Migrations/*.cs`).
- The user owns all migrations. After model/config changes, only mention that they may need to add a migration themselves — do not run tools or write migration code.
